**Addressing Lazy Loading Exports**

I'm now evaluating how to integrate `React.lazy`. The pages currently don't have default exports, so I'll use the `.then(module => ({ default: module.Home }))` pattern. I prefer this approach since it minimizes code changes elsewhere. I'll focus on how to best implement this, and integrate it into my lazy loading process.

I've also turned my attention to the image optimization, specifically how to take advantage of the query parameters that the existing image links include, while ensuring the quality and size of the images is ideal, for all menu items. I'm taking a look at other optimizations as well.


